{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A squad of mutant kids from the hood is humanity\u2019s last hope in this colorful, humor-packed zombie apocalypse. Blast freaky zombies with ridiculous guns, spray wild graffiti across the city, and face a monstrous Zombie Boss at the end of every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero in the squad offers a unique playstyle: choose yours, dig the weirdest guns out of dumpsters, and enjoy the insane headshot animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/6c6e112ccb91699b336248822fed9bb0.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four young mutants, each with their own powers and playstyle, ready to blast some zombies! Pick your favorite (or the one with the collest look) and go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0ff6d3f165d045527ce3ea4302aa1625.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ketchup Blaster, a Gumball Shooter, a Shark-Head Shotgun, and even a Witch\u2019s Broom, you\u2019ll find all sorts of crazy guns to make zombies deeply regret their life (and death) choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7f6276127d1a7baf8c146db958a41638.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The writer definitely went off the rails here. Expect cute puppy zombies, tentacle-armed chonks, jacked-up cop zombies, and even an\u00a0 Frankenstein with underwear. It doesn\u2019t make much sense, but hey, it\u2019s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/74fed60d7408852bdeddaf60d6e66692.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting graffiti in a zombie apocalypse isn\u2019t easy. Every time you try to tag a wall, you might just summon an entire horde of the undead. Art has never been so dangerous (or colorful)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/70af412dc3aa5797303df9165e4828e9.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This zombie clearly had a different breakfast. It\u2019s stronger, meaner, and keeps coming back stronger each time. Beat the Boss Zombie and show it who\u2019s the real monster here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sinister Shootout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/e57e0826bb926f78d3651c5e3b8c7ac74d6ab24a.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting Everywhere!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/801de344ca94ca2404577d16cb35ef14c4806875.jpg"},{"name":"Acrobat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/09cc4a7adb49e1a971b3eac4485da5252dd26853.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja Acrobat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/56005cd2535afb1db9a1814bf84d8d333f2274a9.jpg"},{"name":"Junior Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/248bd6cdcdbe3427c746f85cdb398a01422a9579.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/e40de2098e45bf2abe4badda4e3bee1a2ee7f6b8.jpg"},{"name":"Deadly Pistol!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/8d9419c2266a6d00b8e35ce57041a6a7e50e2727.jpg"},{"name":"Deadly Rifle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/97649845e0d0449acebb2d32fc9670aa423228ce.jpg"},{"name":"Up Close","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/33ef09236113d34a267f466cfa66ea04da401493.jpg"},{"name":"Rambo Mode!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3047820/04bebea3b67b6640fc031be274a1ec97eb8e1c3f.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047820?t=1772225392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/2e8e9ba5871b7785cbba42f699c4d3d536c7aeaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772225392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/ef672a36ba20138d63ca71b6f6573f0a735418b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772225392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/ef672a36ba20138d63ca71b6f6573f0a735418b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772225392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3419980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A squad of mutant kids from the hood is humanity\u2019s last hope in this colorful, humor-packed zombie apocalypse. Blast freaky zombies with ridiculous guns, spray wild graffiti across the city, and face a monstrous Zombie Boss at the end of every mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero in the squad offers a unique playstyle: choose yours, dig the weirdest guns out of dumpsters, and enjoy the insane headshot animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/6c6e112ccb91699b336248822fed9bb0.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7963cb4b1ef69f1836ba11afbfd89cf0.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four young mutants, each with their own powers and playstyle, ready to blast some zombies! Pick your favorite (or the one with the collest look) and go wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0ff6d3f165d045527ce3ea4302aa1625.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/d14465ac72969a95cc467e9c49a4490f.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Ketchup Blaster, a Gumball Shooter, a Shark-Head Shotgun, and even a Witch\u2019s Broom, you\u2019ll find all sorts of crazy guns to make zombies deeply regret their life (and death) choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/7f6276127d1a7baf8c146db958a41638.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/bc089b670e8f7d586bccb22c3dc4a371.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The writer definitely went off the rails here. Expect cute puppy zombies, tentacle-armed chonks, jacked-up cop zombies, and even an\u00a0 Frankenstein with underwear. It doesn\u2019t make much sense, but hey, it\u2019s hilarious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/74fed60d7408852bdeddaf60d6e66692.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/0727dec83ca354d295011daf2ea843e8.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painting graffiti in a zombie apocalypse isn\u2019t easy. Every time you try to tag a wall, you might just summon an entire horde of the undead. Art has never been so dangerous (or colorful)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/70af412dc3aa5797303df9165e4828e9.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.poster.avif?t=1772225392\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/extras/9df68d9bef3dfc604042f2e20a12b425.webm?t=1772225392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This zombie clearly had a different breakfast. It\u2019s stronger, meaner, and keeps coming back stronger each time. Beat the Boss Zombie and show it who\u2019s the real monster here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fogo Games"],"dlc":[4443990],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047820/310aac1eb2624afa93430c949cc1cfd2dc2f0130/header.jpg?t=1772225392","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/812034705/ee3449c78744c9ce597511984634e8d2cd5ccce6/1768532786/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768534624","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/812034705/ee3449c78744c9ce597511984634e8d2cd5ccce6/1768532786/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768534624","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/812034705/ee3449c78744c9ce597511984634e8d2cd5ccce6/1768532786/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768534624","id":257265769,"name":"Launch Trailer - ENG","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257265769/20485f13c78dd93ba2a171d26ba26579fccae44b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768534624"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3047820/821425341/6ac5e6b99